  "sourceTitle": "Shrimp & Wild Rice",
  "sourceText": "Shrimp & Wild Rice\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 17, 2009 - 12:32am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 (10 oz.) frozen shrimp\n1 box long grain\nwild rice\n1 chopped onion\n1 chopped green pepper\n1 cup mushrooms\n1 can cream of mushroom soup\n1/4 pound Velveeta (cut up)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Prepare shrimp and rice to directions. Saute onion and green pepper. Combine all other ingredients and add onion and green pepper. Pour into 2 quart casserole and bake for 1 hour at 350 degrees.",
